# crate - its texture and materials, for 3D programs (Pm Pr Pc Ps: the PBR
# words Blender's importer reads). NEON-CASTER reads crate_mat.png instead

newmtl crate_custom_001d0600
Kd 1 1 1
map_Kd ../hd/models/crate_tex.png
